WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.724
Digital packaging is how the promise arrives: guide, template, cohort, or toolkit.

00:00:04.724 --> 00:00:07.480
This lesson is about digital product packaging.

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:08.661
Guides, templates, cohorts.

00:00:08.661 --> 00:00:11.416
Do not treat this as theory only.

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:15.353
Treat it as a move you can run this week.

00:00:15.353 --> 00:00:21.258
By the end, you should be able to act without waiting for a perfect plan.

00:00:21.258 --> 00:00:25.588
Keep the DigProg habit: watch, practice, then take one real action.

00:00:25.588 --> 00:00:30.312
Stay practical: choose packaging for v1 before you optimize branding or tools.

00:00:30.632 --> 00:00:35.652
Choose packaging for version one based on speed to deliver, not maximum sophistication.

00:00:35.652 --> 00:00:38.356
Remember the objective: choose packaging for v1.

00:00:38.356 --> 00:00:42.604
